A.39. BIR# X X X [...] ki#-sig₁₀#-ga-ke₄
?$ (@gap{2 lines unclear}) 
?#tr.en: …… @fsux{gu-nida} emmer-grain to grow abundantly.
?#tr.en: When the righteous one who takes counsel with @wDN{Enlil} @noteref{i.e. @wRN{Enmerkar}} took away the whole of @wSN{Kulaba},
?#tr.en: like sheep they bent over at the slope of the mountains,
?#tr.en: …… at the edge of the hills they ran forward like wild bulls.
?#tr.en: He sought …… at the side -- they recognised the way.
?#tr.en: He sought …….
#lem: X; X; X; X; X; kisiga[funerary offerings]
#etcsl: line-id=A.39

