:96v.1.1: ($1 ms. has instead:$) KU-ERIN₂
?#tr.en: mixed with date syrup and rolls …… with butter.
?#tr.en: Provisions poured into leather buckets,
?#tr.en: provisions all put into leather bags -- his brothers and friends,
?#tr.en: like a boat unloading from the harvest-place,
?#tr.en: placed stores by his head in the mountain cave.
?#tr.en: They …… water in their leather waterskins.
?#tr.en: Dark beer,
?#tr.en: alcoholic drink,
?#tr.en: light emmer beer,
?#tr.en: wine for drinking which is pleasant to the taste,
?#tr.en: they distributed by his head in the mountain cave as on a stand for waterskins.
?#tr.en: They prepared for him incense resin,
?#tr.en: …… resin,
?#tr.en: aromatic resin,
?#tr.en: @fsux{ligidba} resin and first-class resin on pot-stands in the deep hole;
?#tr.en: they suspended them by his head in the mountain cave.
?#tr.en: They pushed into place at his head his axe whose metal was tin,
?#tr.en: imported from the @wGN{Zubi} mountains.
?#tr.en: They wrapped up by his chest his dagger of iron imported from the @wGN{Gig} (Black) mountains.
?#tr.en: His eyes -- irrigation ditches,
?#tr.en: because they are flooding with water -- holy @wDN{Lugalbanda} kept open, directed towards this.
?#tr.en: The outer door of his lips -- overflowing like holy @wDN{Utu} -- he did not open to his brothers.
?#tr.en: When they lifted his neck,
?#tr.en: there was no breath there any longer.
?#tr.en: His brothers,
?#tr.en: his friends took counsel with one another:
#lem: KU.ERIN₂[food]

