:375v.1.1: ($1 ms. has instead:$) mu-un-LU-[...]
?#tr.en: The banquet was set, the libations were poured -- dark beer,
?#tr.en: alcoholic drink, light emmer beer,
?#tr.en: wine for drinking which is pleasant to the taste.
?#tr.en: Over the plain he poured cool water as a libation.
?#tr.en: He put the knife to the flesh of the brown goats,
?#tr.en: and he roasted the dark livers there. He let their smoke rise there,
?#tr.en: like incense put on the fire.
?#tr.en: As if @wDN{Dumuzid} had brought in the good savours of the cattle pen,
?#tr.en: so @wDN{An},
?#tr.en: @wDN{Enlil},
?#tr.en: @wDN{Enki} and @wDN{Ninḫursaŋa} consumed the best part of the food prepared by @wDN{Lugalbanda}.
?#tr.en: Like the shining place of pure strength,
?#tr.en: the holy altar of @wDN{Suen}, …….
?#tr.en: On top of the altar of @wDN{Utu} and the altar of @wDN{Suen} ……,
?#tr.en: he decorated the two altars with the lapis lazuli …… of @wDN{Inana}.
?#tr.en: @wDN{Suen} ……. He bathed the @fsux{a-an-kar}.
?#tr.en: When he had bathed the ……,
?#tr.en: he set out all the cakes properly.
#lem: X

